<title>FINLAND: Finland budgets FIM 2 bln '98 privatisation income.</title>
<headline>Finland budgets FIM 2 bln '98 privatisation income.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish 1998 state budget proposal includes projected revenues of two billion markka from the privatisation of state companies, finance ministry budget chief Erkki Virtanen told reporters on Friday.</p>
<p>He said two billion markka was a round figure and declined comment on which companies the government may reduce its ownership in.</p>
<p>The government on Friday completed work on its 1998 state budget proposal, which will be given to parliament on September 2.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
